00:16:33.359 --> 00:16:35.627
FROM A CLASS TWO E-BIKE CAN BE,

00:16:35.694 --> 00:16:38.731
BUT MINE WAS JUST ONE OF MANY. I

00:16:38.797 --> 00:16:39.998
