00:16:41.934 --> 00:16:44.503
STORIES. IMAGINE AN ORDINARY

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:45.604
SATURDAY NIGHT IN A SAFE

00:16:45.671 --> 00:16:46.672
NEIGHBORHOOD. A GROUP OF TEENS

00:16:46.739 --> 00:16:49.341
CASUALLY TAKING TURNS ON A NEW

00:16:49.408 --> 00:16:50.476
E-BIKE FOR THE FIRST TIME.

00:16:50.542 --> 00:16:51.744
FAMILIAR SURROUNDINGS CAN LEAD

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:53.545
TO A FALSE SENSE OF SECURITY.

00:16:53.612 --> 00:16:55.647
THEY MIGHT NOT BE WEARING

00:16:55.714 --> 00:16:56.815
HELMETS, EVEN IF THEY NORMALLY

00:16:56.882 --> 00:16:59.284
DO WHEN GOING TO AND FROM SCHOOL

00:16:59.351 --> 00:17:01.920
TO A TEENAGER. THESE BIKES SEEM

00:17:01.987 --> 00:17:04.423
LIKE NORMAL BIKES. 20MPH DOESN'T

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:07.593
FAZE US. IT DOESN'T SOUND FAST

00:17:07.659 --> 00:17:10.829
OR DANGEROUS, BUT THE REALITY IS

00:17:10.896 --> 00:17:11.864
FAR DIFFERENT. FALLS FROM

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:15.000
E-BIKES ARE NOT LIKE FALLS FROM

00:17:15.067 --> 00:17:16.168
NORMAL BIKES. THEY ARE FAR MORE

00:17:16.235 --> 00:17:17.736
COMPARABLE TO VIOLENT FALLS FROM

00:17:17.803 --> 00:17:21.206
MOTORCYCLES. I DON'T REMEMBER

00:17:21.273 --> 00:17:23.976
ANYTHING FROM MY ACCIDENT OR

00:17:24.042 --> 00:17:25.144
FROM THE FIRST TWO MONTHS I

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:27.546
SPENT IN ICUS. ALL AROUND THE

00:17:27.613 --> 00:17:28.647
BAY AREA, ALTHOUGH I DON'T

00:17:28.714 --> 00:17:32.151
REMEMBER. I KNOW MY FAMILY AND

00:17:32.217 --> 00:17:33.285
FRIENDS HAD DOUBTS I'D EVER BE

00:17:33.352 --> 00:17:35.554
BACK TO NORMAL, LIFT A FINGER,

00:17:35.621 --> 00:17:37.923
OR EVEN SURVIVE. DURING THIS

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.057
TIME, I UNDERWENT THREE BRAIN

00:17:39.124 --> 00:17:42.294
SURGERIES. THE FIRST SAVED MY

00:17:42.361 --> 00:17:44.596
LIFE BY RELIEVING EXTREME

00:17:44.663 --> 00:17:45.597
BLEEDING AND SWELLING THROUGH

00:17:45.664 --> 00:17:46.832
THE REMOVAL OF A LARGE SECTION

00:17:46.899 --> 00:17:48.767
OF MY SKULL. THE SECOND AND

00:17:48.834 --> 00:17:51.203
THIRD SURGERIES SAVED MY LIFE

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.806
FROM INFECTIONS. FINALLY, AFTER

00:17:53.872 --> 00:17:57.176
171 DAYS, A FOURTH AND FINAL

00:17:57.242 --> 00:17:59.745
SURGERY RESTORED MY SKULL. NOW

00:17:59.812 --> 00:18:00.813
NINE MONTHS LATER, I AM

00:18:00.879 --> 00:18:02.748
BEGINNING TO MAKE UP FOR ALL THE

00:18:02.815 --> 00:18:04.616
LOST TIME. EVEN WITH SOME OF THE

00:18:04.683 --> 00:18:06.552
BEST MEDICAL CARE IN THE WORLD,

00:18:06.618 --> 00:18:07.953
I AM STILL INCREDIBLY LUCKY. IF

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:11.023
THE SAME INJURY HAD OCCURRED ON

00:18:11.089 --> 00:18:12.191
THE LEFT SIDE OF MY BRAIN

00:18:12.257 --> 00:18:14.126
INSTEAD OF THE RIGHT, I'M TOLD I

00:18:14.193 --> 00:18:16.428
WOULDN'T BE ABLE TO GIVE THIS

00:18:16.495 --> 00:18:18.864
STATEMENT HERE TODAY TO MY FIRST

00:18:18.931 --> 00:18:22.034
RESPONDERS, DOCTORS, NURSES,

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:23.035
THERAPISTS, FAMILY AND FRIENDS.

00:18:23.101 --> 00:18:26.705
I THANK YOU BECAUSE OF YOU, I AM

00:18:26.772 --> 00:18:28.941
HERE AND BECAUSE OF WHAT I HAVE

00:18:29.007 --> 00:18:30.909
LEARNED. I AM HERE TO SPEAK OUT

00:18:30.976 --> 00:18:33.178
TO PROTECT TEENAGERS LIKE ME. I

00:18:33.245 --> 00:18:34.179
THANK ASSEMBLY MEMBER CONNOLLY

00:18:34.246 --> 00:18:36.315
FOR RAISING AWARENESS ABOUT THIS

00:18:36.381 --> 00:18:38.684
